# docs/styling-pass-plan.md Y8, §5.4: the dock lies at the window's foot
# across its width with the content ending above it, its controls inside the
# safe area, and it collapses while its root holds no widget. The dock names
# the player it shows (docs/media-player-plan.md M17).
expect_title "dock"
expect_dock shown
expect_dock_player bound
expect_safe slider@progress
expect_safe button@pause
click button@stop
expect_dock hidden
click button@play
expect_dock shown
expect_no_clipping
